        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If, at any step in Grievance Resolution Process, the University fails to respond within the time period prescribed, the grievant and/or United Academics may advance the grievance to the next step. If, at any step in the Grievance Resolution Process, the grievant or United Academics fails to respond within the time period prescribed, the grievance shall be considered permanently resolved on the basis of the University's latest response.",
